WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Helpoemer

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.210
That's...

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:42.920
Is my brother playing a Shadow Game?

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:03.800
He has to discard a card every turn?

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.510
Damn!  Marik plays dirty!

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:10.570
Jonouchi is at a huge disadvantage.

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:14.480
My turn.  I draw.

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:20.850
Jonouchi has Panther Warrior and Rocket Warrior on his field.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:23.860
They're both Level 4 weaklings.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:25.800
I can destroy them any time.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:32.140
Due to Plasma Eel's effect, Panther Warrior loses 500 attack points every turn.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:36.740
And as long as Plasma Eel is equipped, he can't tribute it.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:43.540
I'll leave his monsters on his field to make him suffer more pain.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:46.580
I set two cards!

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:48.510
I end my turn!

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:50.680
He's not attacking again?

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.990
He has no cards left in his hand.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.920
What's he up to?

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.860
I have one Level 4 monster in my hand.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:04.080
I need to draw a high Level monster.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.800
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.700
Great!  Insect Queen!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:13.340
It's a Level 7 monster, so I need two tributes.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:14.920
I can't summon it yet.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.900
To get ready for the next turn...

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:20.910
I summon Baby Dragon in defense position!

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:25.280
His set cards are probably traps.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.580
Should I hold back?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.900
Or...

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.480
What's wrong?

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.780
I have zero cards in my hand.  Attack me!

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.920
Or are you worried about my set cards?

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:39.140
That's understandable.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:42.000
They may be dangerous traps.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:50.200
They're clearly traps.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.050
He can't attack.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:55.450
Jonouchi!  Stay calm and form a plan!

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:02.730
If I can destroy Drillago, he'll have no monsters to defend with.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.660
If I end my turn, he'll take 0 damage.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:12.600
But due to Plasma Eel, my Panther Warrior will lose more attack points.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:17.100
If I don't do anything because I'm scared of his traps, he'll get further ahead.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.880
I don't know what'll happen, but I have to...

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.960
No!  Don't let him provoke you!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.920
No, he should attack!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.980
If he attacks, Marik will activate his trap.

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:31.580
And he'll reveal his strategy.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:37.850
It's better to do something than nothing and lose Panther Warrior's attack points.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.790
That's what I would do.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.790
Rocket Warrior, attack Drillago!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:52.600
I applaud you for having the courage to attack without fearing my traps!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.200
I activate my set card!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.980
Card of Last Will!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:00.810
What?

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:06.100
Card of Last Will activates when a monster's attack points change.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.850
I draw until I have five cards in my hand.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.690
I don't need a God to defeat you.

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:15.750
Oh no!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.630
Seriously?

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:19.620
No matter what traps you have, I won't stop!

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:24.570
I tribute a Scapegoat so that Panther Warrior can attack!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:30.870
All right!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.180
He did it!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.200
But he still has set cards.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:40.570
I activate the Continuous Trap, Coffin Seller!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.140
What?

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:46.660
Every time your monster goes to the graveyard...

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:50.510
...you lose 300 life points.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:53.420
What?

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.820
The Battle Phase has ended.

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:58.970
Now listen to Helpoemer's song.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.820
It took Insect Queen!

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:11.510
Damn!  First Jinzo, now another high Level monster!

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:16.750
Coffin Seller already dealt you damage!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.520
Judging from you expression, it must've been an important monster.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.760
Quiet you!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.680
It's a scary combo.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:28.910
He loses a card with every attack, and he lose life points if it's a monster.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.400
This is bad!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.400
Your turn is over.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:38.070
Plasma Eel lowers Panther Warrior's attack points!

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.180
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:49.120
I'll show you a more terrifying combo.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.150
I set a card.

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:55.670
I activate the spell card, Premature Burial.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:00.600
Premature Burial Special Summons a monster from the graveyard.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.530
A monster from the graveyard?

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:09.120
I pay 800 life points to Special Summon Drillago in attack position!

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:16.300
I tribute Drillago to summon Legendary Fiend.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.020
It looks strong!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:24.340
I'll tell you one thing.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:27.580
Legendary Fiend has an effect.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:33.460
During each of my Standby Phases, it gains 700 attack points.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.770
What?  700 attack points every turn?

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:43.570
If you don't destroy it soon, its attack points will rise forever.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:45.820
I end my turn.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:52.780
Damn!  There's a monster whose attack points can rise forever?

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:57.640
Jonouchi has more life points, but he's in a worse position.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.080
He's walking all over me.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.620
Can't I do anything?

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.900
If I draw that card...

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.830
...I can destroy his traps.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.270
C'mon!

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:12.430
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:15.370
No.  This isn't the one.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.480
No matter what you try, it's pointless.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:23.940
In that case, I'll use my Rocket Warrior combo again!

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.150
I summon Little-Winguard-

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.680
I don't think so!

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:30.450
I activate the trap card, Nightmare Wheel!

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.320
Rocket Warrior can't move?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:45.000
As long as this card is on the field, your monster can't attack or change battle positions.

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:49.850
His Legendary Fiend will attack me next turn.

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:52.500
I have to strengthen my defenses.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.650
I summon Little-Winguard in defense position!

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:02.780
I also switch Panther Warrior to defense position and end my turn.

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:06.960
Plasma Eel's effect activates!

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:10.180
Panther Warrior loses attack points!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.770
I won't succumb to this pain.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:26.710
This pain keeps me determined to defeat him.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.830
For Mai!

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.060
A Shadow Game.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:36.160
If my brother loses...

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.120
Will he end up like Mai?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.000
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:10:01.310
I forgot to mention that Nightmare Wheel deals you 500 points of damage during my Standby Phase.

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:03.240
What?

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:09.250
Due to its effect, Legendary Fiend gains 700 attack points.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.900
Go, Legendary Fiend!

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:15.120
Attack Little-Winguard!

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:19.490
Dammit!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:30.640
Coffin Seller deals 300 points of damage.

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:34.320
It's fun to see you lose life points automatically.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.640
I set a card!

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.280
You punk!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.070
I end my turn!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.280
Another trap?

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:50.650
When Malevolent Catastrophe activates, all cards on the field go to your graveyard.

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:53.850
There are five monsters on the field.

00:10:53.850 --> 00:11:00.520
So Coffin Seller will deal you 1500 points of damage.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:05.500
And Legendary Fiend will keep gaining attack points.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.950
You have no chance to win.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.650
Jonouchi is getting pummeled!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.580
That scrub can't bait anything out of Marik.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.250
My turn!

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.080
I'm in a worse position after every turn.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:27.650
I need that card to turn this around.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:28.640
C'mon!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:34.800
Your turn will set up my eventual victory!

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:39.040
Entertain me by fighting hard in vain!

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:42.920
You punk!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.720
I can't lose.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.460
I won't lose to this scum!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.080
I can't afford to lose!

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:55.930
Marik!

00:11:55.930 --> 00:12:01.240
Your turns are now going to set up my eventual victory.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:01.900
What?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:05.370
I'll show you my secret weapon!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:08.350
I activate my spell card, Question!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:29.300
I'll show you my secret weapon!

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:32.420
I activate my spell card, Question!

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:34.370
Question?

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:40.150
You have to guess which monster is at the bottom of my graveyard.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:40.840
What?

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:44.510
If you guess correctly, that monster is banished.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:49.480
If you're wrong, it's Special Summoned to my field.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.620
Now guess.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.850
Which monster is at the bottom of my graveyard?

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:00.440
The bottom of his graveyard...

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:04.440
The first monster I sent to the graveyard was Alligator's Sword.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.170
No, that's wrong.

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:12.040
Tribute Burial removed it from the graveyard.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:20.240
That means the bottom monster is the one Helpoemer chose.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:28.220
You don't know which monster it is.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:34.600
Because Helpoemer discards cards randomly.

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:36.670
What's wrong?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.220
He's acting confident.

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:42.700
The monster in his graveyard must be powerful.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.020
Hurry up and answer!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.640
Five more seconds.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:52.480
5... 4... 3... 2... 1...  Done!

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:54.920
You didn't guess.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:57.550
So I get to summon the monster.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.110
Big deal.

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:01.220
No matter what monster you summon...

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:03.980
...Malevolent Catastrophe will send it to the graveyard.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.220
The answer is... this!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.620
Come out, Jinzo!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.230
Jinzo?

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:19.640
Traps are now worthless, Marik.

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:24.720
Check out Jinzo's effect!

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.440
Trap Search!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:37.380
He destroyed all my traps, including Malevolent Catastrophe!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.120
Jinzo!

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.320
All right!  What a comeback!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.570
Awesome, Jonouchi!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:48.240
Well done.  You used Helpoemer's effect to your advantage.

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.960
Jonouchi!  How dare you!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:54.240
How's that, Marik!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:59.500
That's the power of Jinzo, a special card I received in Battle City!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.180
My rare card and Puzzle Card.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.240
Please take them.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.380
Okay.

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:09.580
Will you duel me again sometime?

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.820
Esper Roba...

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:15.080
I'm not an esper anymore.  I'm just Roba.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:18.420
I won't cheat next time.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:22.900
I'm looking forward to it.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.200
Roba.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.370
You have brothers.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:34.140
I have a sister and irreplaceable friends.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:37.680
A person who isn't alone is strong.

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.600
That's right.  A person who isn't alone is strong.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:46.190
I'll defeat the final enemy who stands in my way!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.130
Yugi!  Wait for me in the finals!

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:53.120
Impressive, Jonouchi.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:58.830
Through your duels in Battle City, you're becoming a true duelist.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:04.080
You have pride, soul and strength in your heart.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.510
Marik!  It's my Battle Phase!

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:12.350
Here I go!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:16.300
I switch Baby Dragon and Panther Warrior to attack position!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:20.450
Jinzo attacks!

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:23.150
Take this!  Cyber Energy Shock!

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:30.570
I can't believe he hurt me.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.660
Good!  Marik has no monsters on his field!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:38.880
Jonouchi wins if he can attack him directly!

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.510
You can win, Jonouchi!

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:42.780
Jonouchi!

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.060
When you win, you'll make the finals!

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:48.840
Big brother, this will be a huge upset!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:52.280
Never underestimate the owner of a God Card, Mokuba.

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:57.220
I know that a god won't smile upon him.

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:58.880
Just wait, Mai.

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:02.160
I'll defeat him and save you!

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.760
This is the end!

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:07.880
My monsters attack!

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:12.980
Enough with your nonsense!

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.250
Dark Wall of Wind!

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:17.540
What?

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.820
Monster attacks can't pass through!

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:35.660
Your Battle Phase is over.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:37.060
Plasma Eel!

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:42.740
Panther Warrior is powerless.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.170
Damn.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:47.220
You were overconfident.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:51.610
The hell that awaits you is much worse than this.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:57.800
What punishment shall I give you when you lose?

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:03.220
You will feel ultimate pain, twice as worse than the damage you dealt me.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.730
I want to see my brother's duel.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.300
But Mai is...

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:17.960
What should I do?

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:21.700
My turn!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:23.060
I draw!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:30.230
This card has chosen your punishment.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:33.720
I summon Lava Golem!

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:35.630
3000 attack points?

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:39.420
He can summon a Level 8 monster without tributing?

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:41.660
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.030
I'm not summoning this monster on my field.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:50.200
By tributing two of your monsters, it will serve you.

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:51.270
What?

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:57.970
I tribute Jinzo and Baby Dragon to summon Lava Golem!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.650
What's going on?

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.110
Be happy.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:07.000
You're controlling a monster with 3000 attack points.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:11.920
I'm controlling it?

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.740
W-W-What is that?

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:16.510
Jonouchi is trapped inside a cage!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:20.680
Why would he give a strong monster to his opponent?

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:25.040
A high Level monster that's forcefully summoned to the opponent's field...

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.080
Big brother, what's that?

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:35.640
But its fiery body melts every turn, dealing you 700 points of damage.

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:38.580
That monster is bit of a nuisance.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.680
What?

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:46.980
Hot hot hot!

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:48.760
Damn!  It's so hot!

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:54.700
Since Jinzo is gone, I'll set a card.

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:59.140
Hey!  You're making it obvious that it's a trap!

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:02.980
Well then.  You have 3000 attack points.

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:08.600
Since I have no monsters to defend with, it should be easy to defeat me.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.250
Damn!

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.220
Jonouchi...

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.860
Be careful, Jonouchi!

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:18.920
Stay cool!

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:26.680
He forcefully summoned Lava Golem by tributing two of Jonouchi's monsters.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:32.640
But Marik wouldn't give him a monster with 3000 attack points for nothing.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:37.610
He must have a terrifying strategy planned.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.900
I gave you a powerful monster.

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:45.600
You should say "Thank you."

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:50.800
Maybe you're too scared to speak because you're trapped inside a cage?

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.590
Damn!

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:06.080
Brother...

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:12.880
Damn!  It's too hot!

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.450
I have to do something quick!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.450
Jonouchi, it's your turn.

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:21.500
If you don't hurry, your brain is going to melt.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.820
Marik!  You punk!

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:26.610
What's wrong?

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.490
Attack me with your 3000-attack-point monster!

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:35.920
A new hell awaits you!

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:48.600
Jonouchi is trapped inside a lava monster's cage.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:53.120
But since it has 3000 attack points, attack Marik with that monster!

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.820
But he stopped it with a trap card.

00:21:55.820 --> 00:22:00.120
At the end of every turn, he loses life points and cards in his hand.

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:02.060
Don't give up, Jonouchi!

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:05.800
You still have a hand to make a comeback!

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:09.480
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Comeback!  Gilford the Lightning

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:10.940
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:22.660
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:31.600
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:36.580
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:40.550
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:40.980 --> 00:22:48.520
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:52.090
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:52.090 --> 00:22:56.860
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:56.860 --> 00:23:06.970
And walk it without stopping

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:14.580
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:14.810 --> 00:23:23.550
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:31.530
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:41.370
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
